      "start_seconds": 1.2,
      "end_seconds": 4.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Morning doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.85,
      "end_seconds": 12.92,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "alright no problem at all come in what's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.71,
      "end_seconds": 20.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.39,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got a red hot swelling on my leg."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.58,
      "end_seconds": 25.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Okay shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.42,
      "end_seconds": 39.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Bear with me while this finishes..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.42,
      "end_seconds": 71.42,
      "duration_seconds": 16.0,
      "text": "okay: oxygen saturation is 97 percent blood pressure 125 over 77 pulse is 91 beats a minute and and respiratory rate 18 temperature is 38.3 degrees can you tell me when it first started?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.34,
      "end_seconds": 75.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "probably three days yeah"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.6,
      "end_seconds": 82.64,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "okay, give me more detail on it, whatever comes to mind"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 83.26,
      "end_seconds": 94.71,
      "duration_seconds": 11.45,
      "text": "It comes and goes. I'd give it a three, out of ten. Oh, and a high fever. That's been about the same, six months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 95.97,
      "end_seconds": 99.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "have you had any cut or insect bite?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 101.42,
      "end_seconds": 104.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Yeah, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.88,
      "end_seconds": 108.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "On the cardiac side, anything I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.24,
      "end_seconds": 117.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.5,
      "text": "my heart's been fine, uh, as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.69,
      "end_seconds": 123.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.05,
      "end_seconds": 126.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "no, that's all normal"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 142.56,
      "end_seconds": 146.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "right, before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.33,
      "end_seconds": 149.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.33,
      "end_seconds": 168.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "so, do you have any chronic illnesses?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.39,
      "end_seconds": 172.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Diabetes, for two years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.6,
      "end_seconds": 187.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "tell me your medicines please"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.47,
      "end_seconds": 201.83,
      "duration_seconds": 13.36,
      "text": "I'm on metformin, 500 milligrams, twice a day. My family kept telling me to get it checked. I've never really been one for hospitals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.91,
      "end_seconds": 208.05,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.53,
      "end_seconds": 227.41,
      "duration_seconds": 15.88,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. Not much, I mostly stay in these days. My husband and I live above the shop"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.74,
      "end_seconds": 233.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.49,
      "end_seconds": 239.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 240.36,
      "end_seconds": 241.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "nearly finished here"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.29,
      "end_seconds": 265.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.58,
      "text": "The skin on your leg is dusky with blisters and is very tender, and you are feverish."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.28,
      "end_seconds": 280.8,
      "duration_seconds": 10.52,
      "text": "that's the examination finished let me tell you where I've got to this is probably a severe deep skin infection needing urgent surgery review"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.18,
      "end_seconds": 305.48,
      "duration_seconds": 15.3,
      "text": "Let's book an urgent surgical review to look into possible necrotising infection. I am sending you to hospital now do not wait. Let's get you seen by the the surgical team I'll arrange the letter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.33,
      "end_seconds": 308.03,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.81,
      "end_seconds": 325.31,
      "duration_seconds": 13.5,
      "text": "Urgent blood tests is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks. I'd like you back straight away. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.21,
      "end_seconds": 330.2,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "I mean, I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
